<Layout title="About ToolsQube" description="ToolsQube is a set of free audio, video and image tools that run in your browser.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About ToolsQube</h1>
    <p>ToolsQube is a collection of simple, free tools for everyday audio, video and image jobs: cutting a recording, trimming a video, shrinking a photo to the size a form asks for, or pulling the colors out of a screenshot.</p>
    <h2>Why it exists</h2>
    <p>Most online tools make you upload your files to a server and wait. For personal recordings, videos and photos that is slow and not very private. ToolsQube does the work inside your own browser, so your files stay on your device.</p>
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p>When you open a tool, the code runs locally in your browser using standard web technology. You choose a file, the tool processes it on your computer or phone, and you download the result. We never receive your files.</p>
    <h2>What is coming</h2>
    <p>We keep adding tools. If there is a tool you need, <a href="/contact/">tell us</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
